      <h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help sites remember your preferences, keep you logged in, and understand how visitors use the site. Cookies are not programs — they cannot execute code or contain viruses.</p>

      <h2>Cookies We Use</h2>

      <h3>Essential Cookies</h3>
      <p>These cookies are required for the site to function. They cannot be disabled without breaking core functionality.</p>
      <table class="legal-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Cookie</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Session ID</td><td>Maintains your session across page loads for analytics consistency</td><td>Session</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h3>Analytics Cookies</h3>
      <p>These cookies help us understand how visitors interact with StickVault. All data is aggregated — we don't track individual browsing histories for advertising purposes.</p>
      <table class="legal-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Cookie</th><th>Provider</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>_sv_session</td><td>StickVault (first-party)</td><td>In-house analytics — tracks page views and session data within our own system</td><td>30 days</td></tr>
          <tr><td>_ga, _ga_*</td><td>Google Analytics 4</td><td>Measures site usage, traffic sources, and content performance (when GA4 is active)</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h3>Affiliate Tracking Cookies</h3>
      <p>When you click an affiliate link, the destination merchant may set a cookie to track the referral and attribute any commission. These cookies are set by third-party merchants, not by StickVault directly.</p>
      <table class="legal-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Provider</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Redbubble</td><td>Affiliate referral tracking</td><td>30 days (merchant-controlled)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Other affiliate networks</td><td>Commission attribution for affiliate links we link to</td><td>Varies by merchant</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h3>Third-Party Service Cookies</h3>
      <table class="legal-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Provider</th><th>Purpose</th><th>More Info</th></tr>
        </thead>
